		{
			dependencies: ["30784E3952DDFD84"]
			description: ["&4The Chaos Knight rides under a sky that never looks quite right, as if the world itself twists around him. His armor flickers between colors, runes crawling like living things across the metal, and each step of his mount leaves a smear of unstable magic behind. We’ve seen where he’s passed: stone warped into strange shapes, trees half-turned to ash and half to obsidian. To fight him is to stand inside a storm of blades and raw sorcery, hoping your mind holds together longer than his patience."]
