		}
		{
			dependencies: ["30784E3952DDFD84"]
			description: ["&4Fire and ice shouldn’t work together, but these two make it an art. The Pyromancer bathes the field in searing heat, turning cover to ash, while the Cryomancer steals that same heat away, locking flame and foe alike in jagged prisons of frost. We watched them toy with a band of marauders, freezing them in place before shattering their defenses with roaring firestorms. If we rush one, the other will punish us; we’ll have to dance between extremes, using their own chaos against them."]
			id: "12B8E3E586F259E2"
